note verify-seo.om: page-level gates of the oracle (oracle.rs, seo.rs verify, contact.rs, voice.rs):
note O1 registry both ways (PAGES and the engineer record) with translation pairs, O2 every head,
note O3 the six destinations, O4 the root door, O5 assets resolve, O6 sitemap lists the registry,
note C1-C8 the machine surface, G contact on every page, F singular voice with the sourced quotes.
